pseudocode:
1. dp = Array(N).fill(-1); dp[0] = 0;
2. for week in 0 to K-1:
3.   next_dp = Array(N).fill(-1);
4.   for curr in 0 to N-1:
5.     if dp[curr] == -1: continue;
6.     for next in 0 to N-1:
7.       if curr == next or flights[curr][next] == 1:
8.         next_dp[next] = max(next_dp[next], dp[curr] + days[next][week]);
9.   dp = next_dp;
